@startuml
skinparam titleFontSize 24
skinparam defaultFontName "Arial"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

title **GitHub Actions CI/CD Pipeline for API Deployment**

participant "GitHub Actions Workflow" as GHA
box "Source Code" #LightBlue
    participant "GitHub Repository" as Repo
end box
box "Container Registry" #LightGreen
    participant "Docker Hub" as DockerHub
end box
box "Google Cloud Platform" #LightSalmon
    participant "Google Cloud SDK" as GCSDK
    participant "Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE)" as GKE
    participant "Kubernetes API" as K8sAPI
end box

Repo --> GHA : Push to main / Workflow Dispatch (Trigger)

GHA -> GHA : Checkout Code
GHA -> GCSDK : Install GCP SDK & GKE Auth Plugin
GHA -> GHA : Setup Docker Buildx
GHA -> DockerHub : Login (using secrets)

activate GHA
GHA -> GHA : Navigate to 'api' directory
GHA -> DockerHub : **Build & Push Docker Image** (flamware/capiot-api:$TAG)
deactivate GHA
note right of GHA
    Image Tag: YYYYMMDDHHMMSS-SHA8
    Output 'image_tag' for later steps
end note

GHA -> GHA : Setup Kubectl
GHA -> GCSDK : Authenticate to GCP (using GKE_CREDENTIALS)
GHA -> GKE : Get GKE Credentials\n(cluster: capiot-eu-cluster, location: europe-west9)

activate GKE
GHA -> K8sAPI : **Create/Update ConfigMap**\n(flyway-migration-scripts, namespace: capiot,\n from database/migration files)
GHA -> K8sAPI : **Update Deployment**\n(api-backend-deployment to use new image tag)
K8sAPI -> GKE : Rollout Status Check
GHA -> K8sAPI : Get Deployment YAML (for logging/debugging)
deactivate GKE

@enduml